# RAPID cheat sheet
## Shortcuts
- **ctrl + m** -> set pointer to main
- **f8**-> start program

- **f11** -> setp in function durin debug mode
- **f12** -> step over durin debug mode

## good to know
- to run scrips, robot need to be in automatic mode
- to run scripts on real life robot, need to **Controller -> Add Controller ->One CLick Connect**. Then **Controller ->Request Write Access**
